nodes.body:
@michaelzhang-ai 
for 1., the evidence of this PR making VRAM back to 0% is insufficient without before/after comparison, for example:
 [PR Test (AMD) · sgl-project/sglang@b94ac87](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/29215394044/job/86710193512) mi325 has 0% vram without this PR, 
the recent vram issues are on MI355 not MI325.
and most of the MI355 jobs start with 0% vram now but end with GPU hang issue.
for 2., I think we need at least one or two complete MI355 runs before we can be confident this PR has no side effects.

